# Prodi9al Hyprland Config — Pipe-separated value config deployment list
# Format: flag|path|target|dependency
#
# Flags:
#   P = Populate/Preserve — copy only if target does not exist
#   S = Sync — copy and overwrite
#   O = Overwrite — move to backup, then copy
#   B = Backup only
#   T = Trash — move target to backup, skip further processing
#   I = Ignore — skip this entry
#
# Only known variable: ${HOME}

 Prodi core files 
P|${HOME}/.config/prodi|config.toml|hyprland
P|${HOME}/.config/hypr|hyprland.lua hypridle.conf hyprlock.conf hyprsunset.conf|hyprland
P|${HOME}/.config/hypr/themes|theme.conf wallbash.conf colors.conf|hyprland
P|${HOME}/.config/pypr|config.toml|hyprland
S|${HOME}/.config/systemd|user|systemd

 Prodi core files — uwsm 
S|${HOME}/.config/uwsm|env env-hyprland env.d env-hyprland.d|systemd hyprland uwsm

 Prodi core files — xdg-terminal-exec 
P|${HOME}/.config|xdg-terminals.list|xdg-utils

